'''Paper Rex''' is a Southeast Asian esports organization based in Singapore. It was founded in January 2020 by legendary ''[[counterstrike:Main_Page|Counter-Strike]]'' player, Harley "[[counterstrike:Dsn|dsn]]" Örwall, together with the founder and chief editor of [https://csgo2asia.com/ CSGO2ASIA], Nikhil "[[nikH]]" Hathiramani.

