==Trivia==
*First Singaporean organization to reach 1 million {{Abbr/USD}} in earnings.
*Them and [[Fnatic]] share the title of second most earning organization of 2023 (Total Winnings: $645,000). <ref>{{cite web|url=https://liquipedia.net/valorant/Statistics/2023|title=Statistics 2023|date=2023-12-31|author=[[Liquipedia]]}}</ref>
*They are the first Southeast-Asian Organisation to reach a Grand Final of an international event, that being ([[VCT/2022/Stage_2/Masters|VCT: Stage 2 Masters - Copenhagen]])
*The team is known for their unique style of calling where all players call so there is no In-Game Leader <ref>{{cite web|url=https://bo3.gg/valorant/news/something-from-paper-rex-we-dont-have-an-igl-but-we-act-as-a-unified-team|title=Something from Paper Rex: "We don't have an IGL, but we act as a unified team"|date=2024-04-08|author='''bo3.gg'''}}</ref>

